### Create an admin
POST http://localhost:8081/api/admins
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "admin123",
  "fullName": "Feroz Admin",
  "email": "admin1@kuet.ac.bd",
  "office": "Registrar Office"
}

### Get all admins
GET http://localhost:8081/api/admins

### Get one admin
GET http://localhost:8081/api/admins/1

### Update admin
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/admins/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "fullName": "Feroz Admin Updated",
  "email": "admin1@kuet.ac.bd",
  "office": "Dean Office"
}

### Delete admin
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/admins/1

### Create teacher
POST http://localhost:8081/api/teachers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "teacher1",
  "password": "teach123",
  "fullName": "Dr. Rahman",
  "email": "teacher1@kuet.ac.bd",
  "department": "CSE",
  "designation": "Professor"
}

### Get all teachers
GET http://localhost:8081/api/teachers

### Create student
POST http://localhost:8081/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student1",
  "password": "stud123",
  "fullName": "Feroz",
  "email": "student1@kuet.ac.bd",
  "rollNumber": "2207087",
  "department": "CSE"
}

### Get all students
GET http://localhost:8081/api/students

### Duplicate roll number (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student2",
  "password": "stud123",
  "fullName": "Another",
  "email": "student2@kuet.ac.bd",
  "rollNumber": "2207087",
  "department": "CSE"
}





### 1. No login: expect 401
GET http://localhost:8081/api/teachers

### 2. Wrong password: expect 401
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=wrong

### 3. Login as ADMIN: expect 200
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=admin123

### 4. Admin can access all three: expect 200 each
GET http://localhost:8081/api/admins

###
GET http://localhost:8081/api/teachers

###
GET http://localhost:8081/api/students

### 5. Logout: expect 200
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/logout

### 6. After logout: expect 401
GET http://localhost:8081/api/admins

### 7. Login as TEACHER
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=teacher1&password=teach123

### Teacher on teachers: expect 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/teachers

### Teacher on students: expect 403
GET http://localhost:8081/api/students

### Teacher on admins: expect 403
GET http://localhost:8081/api/admins

### 8. Logout, then login as STUDENT
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/logout

###
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=student1&password=stud123

### Student on students: expect 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/students

### Student on teachers: expect 403
GET http://localhost:8081/api/teachers

### Student on admins: expect 403
GET http://localhost:8081/api/admins